draft: DRAFT-libpappsomspp-qt6-component-mapping
status: pending-editor-review
title: "Qt6 组件多包拼装的 CMake 前缀解析——qtbase-sql-dbus 空壳包陷阱与 qtbase 本尊前置"
category: conan, cmake, qt
match_keywords: >
  qt6, qtbase, qtbase-sql-dbus, cmake_prefix_path, qt_additional_packages_prefix_path,
  qt6sql, qt6svg, qt6qml, core5compat, 空壳, prefix 顺序, find_package Qt6
error_signature: >
  Could NOT find Qt6(Sql|Svg|Qml)|Expected Config file .* does NOT exist|
  The link interface of target .* contains .* but the target was not found|
  Add the installation prefix of "qtbase(-sql-dbus)?" to CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH
root_cause: >
  OHOS 制品仓的 Qt6 拆成多包（qtbase/qt5compat/qtbase-sql-dbus/qtdeclarative/qtsvg），
  其中 qtbase-sql-dbus 包目录的 lib/cmake 下是一棵"空壳 Qt6 树"：有 Qt6/Qt6Config.cmake
  和 Qt6Sql 目录名但 Qt6SqlDependencies.cmake 等 find_dependency 链文件缺失/为空壳，
  Qt6Sql/Qt6Svg 的完整 config 只在 qtbase 本尊包目录。CMake 的 find_package(Qt6
  COMPONENTS Sql) 命中哪个 Qt6Config 取决于 CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH 顺序——空壳排前则
  "Expected Config file ... does NOT exist"；且 conan conan_cmakedeps_paths.cmake 的
  list(PREPEND ...) 语义是"后写的前面"，qtbase 行先 append 会被后续 PREPEND 压后。
solution: |
  # conanfile.py generate()：qtbase 的路径行必须最后追加（PREPEND 语义最终最前）
  lines = []
  qtbase = self.dependencies.get("qtbase")
  if qtbase:
      qt_pkg = qtbase.package_folder
      lines.append(f'list(PREPEND CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH "{qt_pkg}/lib/cmake")')
      lines.append(f'list(PREPEND CMAKE_LIBRARY_PATH "{qt_pkg}/lib")')
      lines.append(f'list(PREPEND CMAKE_INCLUDE_PATH "{qt_pkg}/include")')
  # ... 其他包（qt5compat/qtsvg/...）的 PREPEND 行写在前面
  qtbase_lines = [l for l in lines if qtbase and qtbase.package_folder in l]
  lines = [l for l in lines if l not in qtbase_lines]
  lines.extend(qtbase_lines)   # qtbase 最后写=最终排最前
  # 消费端（test_package）：QT_ADDITIONAL_PACKAGES_PREFIX_PATH 必须在第一次
  # find_package(Qt6 ...) 之前设置（Svg/Qml/Core5Compat 组件在各自包里）：
  #   set(QT_ADDITIONAL_PACKAGES_PREFIX_PATH "$ENV{PAPPSOMSPP_QT_EXTRA_PREFIX}")
  #   find_package(Qt6 COMPONENTS Core Gui Xml Concurrent Sql Svg REQUIRED)
fallback: >
  若包无 install(EXPORT) config（只有 StaticTargets）：绕过 find_package，
  直接 include "${pkg}/lib/cmake/<name>/XxxStaticTargets.cmake" 并手工
  find_package 全部传递依赖（liblzf/OdsStream/PwizLite/Boost/ZLIB/Zstd/
  SQLite3）+QuaZip-Qt6（libodsstream 包内 vendored）+conan target 别名映射
  （zstd::libzstd→Zstd::Zstd 等 ALIAS）。
verify_builds: "#55660(#11883 libodsstream CI passed), #12063 本机 conan create 60/60"
reference_impl: >
  PR #12063 libpappsomspp 0.11.26（Qt6 线四件链主件）+ PR #11883 libodsstream
  0.9.18（CI 环境 sql-dbus 空壳抢 include 修复 87349f23）；
  pimcommunity core-only port 先例；akonadi/actiona Qt 组件拆包先例
id: E6401
doc_file: doc/E6401.md
